# A person reviews each change to a guardrail file: a file that configures a
# check, a lint rule, a budget, a test rule or an agent hook.
# tools/guardrail-files.json lists them. check-agent-hooks keeps this file in
# step with that list, and check-guardrail-coverage keeps that list in step
# with what the checks read. Kickoff replaces @eggdev with the owner of the
# project.
#
# Escape hatches live in these files. A reviewer checks each one: an override
# that turns a lint rule off (oxlint.config.ts), a raised file-size budget
# (tools/file-size-budgets.json), a knip ignore (knip.jsonc), a registry
# exception or a transaction-safe service (primitives.yaml), and an allowed
# test removal (tools/test-integrity-allow.json). The review rules
# (docs/contributing/review.md) decide what agent review blocks.

